@startuml
title Algorithm Performance Analyzer

actor Student
component "Performance Analyzer" as Analyzer
component "Sorting Algorithms" as Algorithms
database "performance_results.csv" as Results
component "Graph Generator" as Plotter
artifact "performance_graphs.png" as Graph

Student --> Analyzer : run benchmark
Analyzer --> Algorithms : sort test inputs
Analyzer --> Results : write timings
Results --> Plotter : read results
Plotter --> Graph : generate graph
Student --> Graph : inspect comparison
@enduml